-audit-trail.\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJKYS8K4WAZNB3Y08351NJ01\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T05:43:49.093Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"Execution context:\\n- Background: implement the missing CLI orchestration for stale active session cleanup so candidate/metadata helpers are reachable from users.\\n- Scope: add `kspec session stale close` command with targeting validation (<session-id> vs --refs vs --all), criteria flags, dry-run/apply modes, confirmation behavior, and JSON/human summaries including per-session reasons/totals.\\n- Files: src/cli/commands/session/commands.ts, new src/cli/commands/session/stale-close.ts, and new CLI tests for stale close behavior/AC coverage.\\n- Verification: targeted stale-close tests, full npm test, and kspec validate before submit.\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJKZBJTKCBCRCEWGEH8B06P5\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T05:53:49.395Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"Implemented `kspec session stale close` end-to-end CLI orchestration for @session-stale-cleanup. Added new `session stale` command group + `close` subcommand with target-mode validation (`<session-id>` vs `--refs` vs `--all`), stale criteria parsing (`--older-than`, `--inactive-for`, `--liveness-guard`), dry-run/apply behavior, confirmation gating (`--force`, non-interactive/JSON handling), per-session reason reporting, and aggregate totals (`candidates`, `changed_sessions`, `skipped_sessions`, `failures`). Command reuses `selectStaleActiveSessions` + `applyAutoAbandonMetadata` and sets a command-specific shadow commit message for applied closures. Added CLI coverage in `tests/session-stale-close.test.ts` for own ACs (`ac-1`..`ac-9`) plus refs batch/error/confirmation traits.\\n\\nVerification:\\n- `npm run build`\\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-close.test.ts` (11 passed)\\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts tests/session-stale-close.test.ts` (24 passed)\\n- `npm test` (baseline failure: existing timeouts in `tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts` lines 34 and 104)\\n- `kspec validate` (reports pre-existing project-wide schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task)\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJKZD34PP8NEG0KYCW8YD95M\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T05:54:38.871Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"Submitted for review in PR #621: https://github.com/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pull/621 (branch feat/session-stale-close-command, commit b57152010). Implemented `kspec session stale close` orchestration with target-mode validation (`<session-id>`/`--refs`/`--all`), stale criteria flags, dry-run/apply behavior, confirmation gating, per-session reason reporting, and totals output. Added CLI coverage in tests/session-stale-close.test.ts for @session-stale-cleanup ACs and batch/confirmation traits.\\n\\nVerification:\\n- `npm run build`\\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\\n- `npm test` (pre-existing timeouts in tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts lines 34 and 104)\\n- `kspec validate` (pre-existing project-wide schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task)\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJM03MG7DYCG1JS89Y50B0G9\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T06:06:57.543Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: MUST-FIX: inherited trait AC coverage incomplete for @session-stale-cleanup (missing @trait-dry-run ac-4, @trait-json-output ac-3, @trait-error-guidance ac-3/ac-4/ac-5, @trait-multi-ref-batch ac-1/ac-3/ac-5); regression gate failing (npm test: tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts timeouts).\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJM0J78GJYPKSB4DF3ZNMYV9\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T06:14:55.504Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"[FIX_CYCLE: 2] Addressed blocking review findings for @session-stale-cleanup by completing missing inherited trait AC coverage and guidance behavior.\\n\\nChanges:\\n- Added missing AC annotations/tests in tests/session-stale-close.test.ts for:\\n  - @trait-dry-run ac-4\\n  - @trait-json-output ac-3\\n  - @trait-error-guidance ac-3/ac-5 (with ac-4 marked N/A + reason)\\n  - @trait-multi-ref-batch ac-1/ac-3/ac-5\\n- Added JSON error-mode coverage to verify structured `error` payloads.\\n- Added validation-error coverage to assert field/value detail reporting.\\n- Updated stale-close command resolution error messages to include actionable recovery guidance (`kspec session list --status active`) for missing/ambiguous refs.\\n\\nVerification:\\n- `npm run build`\\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\\n- `npm test` (baseline failure remains in tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts timeouts at lines 34 and 104)\\n- `kspec validate` (pre-existing project-wide schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task)\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJM14M4X9YVGS6ECJBDC8FNA\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T06:24:58.526Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"[FIX_CYCLE: 3] Review findings: MUST-FIX: Regression gate still failing on PR #621 head f1ce5c9 (npm test exit 1). Failures: tests/cli-serve.test.ts assertion mismatch and two timeout failures in tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts. AC coverage gaps from prior review are resolved; only full-suite green gate remains.\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJM25SP16KPJV7VJHJRAMVNN\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T06:43:05.537Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"[FIX_CYCLE: 4] Resolved regression gate blockers by hardening flaky tests: isolated HOME in tests/cli-serve.test.ts no-projects case to avoid shared daemon PID/port cross-test interference, and increased session-note-limit integration test timeouts to 90s (observed runtimes 43s and 59s). Verification: npx vitest run tests/cli-serve.test.ts tests/cli/session-no